Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Translate the app UI to Spanish

- All visible texts in Spanish (home, editor, sounds, run screen,
  settings, import/export, what's new)
- Built-in interval names (Work, Rest, ...) stay as internal keys and
  are shown in Spanish through displayIntervalName()
- Material widgets localized to es_ES via flutter_localizations
- Integration tests updated to the Spanish texts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5W6dQ9ZgyihWUfbUDrb4L
